        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, when the spread of COVID-19 in 2020 led to a decrease in demand for our services at a major Asian aviation hub and in the hospitality industry, we pivoted to provide our services to healthcare facilities as well as increased disinfection services.",
        "start_character": 13019,
        "end_character": 13280
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, the new FM01 workhead for “Facilities Management” requires contractors to provide at least two distinct maintenance services (for which we are able to provide cleaning and pest control services in-house), thus ensuring that we are able to continue tendering for public projects.",
        "start_character": 13604,
        "end_character": 13891
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Going forward, we intend to continue to seek out opportunities for collaboration with technology companies to develop innovations in the areas of cleaning services and facilities management.",
        "start_character": 20667,
        "end_character": 20857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our core facilities services, we provide cleaning services to offices.",
        "start_character": 7759,
        "end_character": 7844
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to the provision of cleaning services, we have diversified into waste management and pest control services as well as customer services.",
        "start_character": 13281,
        "end_character": 13429
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we intend to expand our services offered through HomeHelpy to include services such as disinfection and air conditioner servicing.",
        "start_character": 30875,
        "end_character": 31018
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with the expansion of customer services, we may also provide security services to condominiums.",
        "start_character": 23532,
        "end_character": 23641
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the future, we also intend to use this center to provide training in connection with specialized cleaning services such as cleaning of healthcare facilities, cleanrooms and data centers, as well as customer services.",
        "start_character": 59534,
        "end_character": 59753
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through CSG, we manufacture a variety of cleaning supplies such as hand soaps, hand soap dispensers, and cleaning fluids used for general, floor, carpet, restroom or kitchen purposes, as well as treatment products used in the marine industry.",
        "start_character": 33498,
        "end_character": 33740
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our customer service business, we provide customer service officers and F&B service crew to venues such as healthcare facilities, hotels and restaurants.",
        "start_character": 1441,
        "end_character": 1602
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the contract, we provide, among other things, cleaning and pest control services for numerous areas within Temasek Polytechnic’s campus.",
        "start_character": 37687,
        "end_character": 37829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001213900-26-082565",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001213900-26-082565-c615024fdc727ccf",
        "accession_number": "0001213900-26-082565",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have started to offer, on a limited basis, an EV charging function to our customers as a package in our services, which will be provided by a sub-contracted third party.",
